# CodeAlpha Ecommerce Sales Analysis

## Project Overview
This project performs Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) and Data Visualization on an e-commerce sales dataset.

## Objectives
- Analyze sales and profit performance
- Compare different product categories
- Analyze regional sales
- Identify top-selling products
- Study the relationship between sales and profit
- Check data quality

## Tools & Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Google Colab
- GitHub

## Tasks Completed
- Task 2: Exploratory Data Analysis
- Task 3: Data Visualization

## Dataset
Sample Superstore dataset.

## Conclusion
The project demonstrates how Python-based data analysis and visualization can be used to identify useful patterns and insights from e-commerce sales data.
